{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-115-1","title":"Psalms 115:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":115,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":115,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Because God is truly glorious, 4 and idols are vanity, 9 he exhorts to confidence in God. 12 God is to be blessed for his blessings.</p>\n<p>A.M. 3108. B.C. 896. (Title.)This seems to be an [epinikion,] or triumphal song, in which the victory is wholly ascribed to Jehovah; and to none can it be referred with more propriety than to that of Jehoshaphat over the confederated forces of his enemies, 2 Ch 20.</p>\n<p>unto us. 74:22; 79:9,10; Jos 7:9; Isa 48:11; Eze 20:14; 36:32; Da 9:19 Eph 1:6; Re 4:10,11 for thy mercy. 61:7; 89:1,2; Mic 7:20; Joh 1:17; Ro 15:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-115-2","title":"Psalms 115:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":115,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":115,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>42:3,10; 79:10; Ex 32:12; Nu 14:15,16; De 32:26,27; 2Ki 19:10-19 Joe 2:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-115-3","title":"Psalms 115:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":115,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":115,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>But our. 2:4; 68:4; 123:1; 1Ch 16:25; Mt 6:9 he hath. 135:6; Isa 46:10; Da 4:35; Ro 9:19; Eph 1:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-115-4","title":"Psalms 115:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":115,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":115,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Their idols.They are metal, stone, and wood; and though generally made in the form of man, they can neither see, hear, smell, feel, walk, nor speak! Even the wiser heathen made them the objects of their jests.</p>\n<p>97:7; 135:15-17; De 4:28; Isa 40:19,20; 42:17; 46:1,2,6,7 Jer 10:3-5; Ho 8:6; Hab 2:18-20; Ac 19:26,35; 1Co 10:19,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-115-8","title":"Psalms 115:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":115,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":115,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>135:18; Isa 44:9-20; Jer 10:8; Jon 2:8; Hab 2:18,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-115-9","title":"Psalms 115:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":115,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":115,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Israel. 118:2-4; 135:19,20; Ex 19:5 trust. 62:8; 125:1; 130:7; 146:5,6; Jer 17:17,18; Eph 1:12 their help. 33:20,21; 84:11; De 33:29; Pr 30:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-115-10","title":"Psalms 115:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":115,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":115,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Ex 28:1; Nu 16:5,40; 18:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-115-11","title":"Psalms 115:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":115,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":115,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>33:18; 118:4; 147:11; Pr 14:26; 30:5; Ac 10:35; Re 19:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-115-12","title":"Psalms 115:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":115,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":115,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>hath. 25:7; 136:23; Ge 8:1; Ex 2:24,25; Isa 44:21; 49:14-16; Ac 10:4 the house of Israel. 67:7; Ge 12:2,3; 2:17,18; Ac 3:26; Ga 3:14,29; Eph 1:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-115-13","title":"Psalms 115:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":115,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":115,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>He will bless. 29:11; 112:1; 128:1,4,5; Mal 3:16,17; 4:2; Lu 1:50; Ac 13:26 Col 3:11 both small. Ac 26:22; Re 11:18; 19:5; 20:12 and. Heb. with.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-115-14","title":"Psalms 115:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":115,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":115,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Lord. Ge 13:16; 2Sa 24:3; Isa 2:2,3; 27:6; 19:20,21; 56:8; 60:4-22 Jer 30:19; 33:22; Ho 1:10; Zec 8:20-23; 10:8; Re 7:4,9 you. Ge 17:7; Jer 32:38,39; Ac 2:39; 3:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-115-15","title":"Psalms 115:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":115,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":115,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>blessed. 3:8; Ge 14:19; 32:26-29; Eph 1:3,4; 1Pe 3:9 made. 96:5; 146:5,6; Ge 1:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-115-16","title":"Psalms 115:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":115,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":115,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>heaven. 89:11; 144:5; 148:4; Isa 66:1; La 3:66; Joh 14:2 but the earth. Ge 1:28-30; 9:1-3; De 32:8; Jer 27:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-115-17","title":"Psalms 115:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":115,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":115,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>dead. 6:5; 30:9; 88:10-12; Isa 38:18,19 go down. 31:17; 1Sa 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-115-18","title":"Psalms 115:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":115,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":115,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>113:2; 118:17-19; 145:2,21; Da 2:20; Re 5:13</p>"}]}